==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[óska]]'' meaning "to [[wish]]" + ''[[til hamingju]]'' meaning "[[congratulations]]".

===Verb===
{{is-verb|head=[[óska]] [[til hamingju]]}}

# to [[congratulate]]
#: {{ux|is|Átti hann ekki eftir að '''óska''' þér '''til hamingju'''?|He's yet to '''congratulate''' you isn't he?}}

